# Commit author

Every Git commit in this repository must be authored as:

- **Name:** `cuephoriatech`
- **Email:** `cuephoriatech@gmail.com`

Never commit as `axeist`, `ranjithkirloskar@gmail.com`, or a GitHub noreply address.

When creating a commit, pass the author explicitly:

```bash
git -c user.name="cuephoriatech" -c user.email="cuephoriatech@gmail.com" commit ...
```

If the latest commit used a different author, do not leave it that way — amend only when amend rules allow; otherwise create a new commit with this author.
